{"paragraphs":[{"text":"%md\n# Building the Cassandra database\n### Ref. '5.3 Database/Tabell Design' in report.\n___\n**Note**  \nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:\n1. [1_Capstone_CQL_DB_Build.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n2. [2_Capstone_Frame_to_Table.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n3. [3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln](https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone)\n___\nThis notebook is created with the intention of beeing a single run document to build the CQL database with keyspaces and tables that fulfill the requirement to complete the assigned CQL related tasks for \"Capstone\" in the project assigment.  \nThe first time this document is run the following actions will be executed:  \n- Create a keyspace to contain the tables.\n- Create tables that resonates with the hypothesis created for the capstone data:\n1. Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden på hverdager mellom 07.00 - 08.00 og 15.00 - 16.00.\n2. Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er høyere i ettermiddags rushet mellom 15.00 - 16.00 enn 07.00 - 08.00 på hverdager.\n3. Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.\n4. Det finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10.00 - 14.00.\n5. Det finnes en negativ korrelasjon for temperatur og total biltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10.00 - 14.00.\n6. Data kan benyttes til å forutsi om det er blitt utført veiarbeid eller vedlikehold på et gitt trafikk registreringspunkt basert på uregelmessigheter i trafikkmålinger.","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-12T23:38:12+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":true,"language":"markdown","completionSupport":false},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":true,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762981309943_1952021603","id":"paragraph_1762981309943_1952021603","dateCreated":"2025-11-12T21:01:49+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":true,"dateFinished":"2025-11-12T23:38:17+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-12T23:38:12+0000","results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"<div class=\"markdown-body\">\n<h1>Building the Cassandra database</h1>\n<h3>Ref. &lsquo;5.3 Database/Tabell Design&rsquo; in report.</h3>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Note</strong><br />\nThis notebook is part of a collections which has to be run in the following order to work as intended:</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">1_Capstone_CQL_DB_Build.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">2_Capstone_Frame_to_Table.zpln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AndreasIsaksen/BD_project_appendices_gruppe1/tree/zpln/zpln/final/Capstone\">3_Capstone_Cassandra_Queries.zpln</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p>This notebook is created with the intention of beeing a single run document to build the CQL database with keyspaces and tables that fulfill the requirement to complete the assigned CQL related tasks for &ldquo;Capstone&rdquo; in the project assigment.<br />\nThe first time this document is run the following actions will be executed:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create a keyspace to contain the tables.</li>\n<li>Create tables that resonates with the hypothesis created for the capstone data:</li>\n</ul>\n<ol>\n<li>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad gjennom én time er høyest i rushtiden på hverdager mellom 07.00 - 08.00 og 15.00 - 16.00.</li>\n<li>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er høyere i ettermiddags rushet mellom 15.00 - 16.00 enn 07.00 - 08.00 på hverdager.</li>\n<li>Den totale trafikkmengden inn og ut av Fredrikstad er lavere i juli måned enn for resten av året.</li>\n<li>Det finnes en positiv korrelasjon for temperatur og total sykkeltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10.00 - 14.00.</li>\n<li>Det finnes en negativ korrelasjon for temperatur og total biltrafikk i Fredrikstad målt over en referanseperiode mellom 10.00 - 14.00.</li>\n<li>Data kan benyttes til å forutsi om det er blitt utført veiarbeid eller vedlikehold på et gitt trafikk registreringspunkt basert på uregelmessigheter i trafikkmålinger.</li>\n</ol>\n\n</div>"}]}},{"text":"%cassandra\r\nCREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS capstone_ks\r\nWITH replication = {\r\n    'class' : 'SimpleStrategy',\r\n    'replication_factor' : 1\r\n};","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-12T20:54:08+0000","progress":0,"config":{"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"results":{},"enabled":true,"editorSetting":{"language":"scala","editOnDblClick":false,"completionKey":"TAB","completionSupport":true}},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"results":{"code":"SUCCESS","msg":[{"type":"HTML","data":"\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <h5>No Result &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a role=\"button\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#4e30725f-afc0-48db-875a-780345c31bd2\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n      <span class=\"text-info\"><strong>Last query execution info</strong></span>\n    </a>\n  </h5>\n</div>\n<div class=\"panel panel-default\">\n  <div id=\"4e30725f-afc0-48db-875a-780345c31bd2\" class=\"panel-collapse collapse\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n    <div class=\"panel-body\">\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"col-md-3\"></div>\n        <div class=\"col-md-6 col-offset-md-3 table-responsive table-bordered\">\n          <table class=\"table\">\n            <thead>\n              <tr>\n                <th>Information</th>\n                <th style=\"text-align:left\">Value</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Statement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">CREATE KEYSPACE IF NOT EXISTS capstone_ks\r\nWITH replication = {\r\n    'class' : 'SimpleStrategy',\r\n    'replication_factor' : 1\r\n};</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Tried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Queried Hosts</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">cassandra-seed:9042</td>\n              </tr>\n              <tr>\n                <td>Schema in Agreement</td>\n                <td style=\"text-align:left\">true</td>\n              </tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"}]},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762961228634_650686154","id":"paragraph_1762894754977_2127378393","dateCreated":"2025-11-12T15:27:08+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-12T20:54:08+0000","dateFinished":"2025-11-12T20:54:11+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false},{"text":"%md","user":"anonymous","dateUpdated":"2025-11-13T00:06:34+0000","progress":0,"config":{"tableHide":false,"editorSetting":{"editOnDblClick":false,"language":"scala","completionSupport":true,"completionKey":"TAB"},"colWidth":12,"fontSize":9,"editorHide":false,"results":{},"enabled":true},"settings":{"params":{},"forms":{}},"apps":[],"runtimeInfos":{},"progressUpdateIntervalMs":500,"jobName":"paragraph_1762981302717_978838562","id":"paragraph_1762981302717_978838562","dateCreated":"2025-11-12T21:01:42+0000","status":"FINISHED","focus":false,"dateFinished":"2025-11-13T00:06:01+0000","dateStarted":"2025-11-13T00:05:58+0000","results":{}},{"text":"%cassandra\nUSE capstone_ks;\n\nCREATE TABLE IF 